-/* ============================== LOUNGE LIVE TV ==============================
- * Four independent TVs on the bar wall, one tuner each.
- * Lineup (iptv-org database, main US feeds): CBS News 24/7 - ABC News Live -
- * CNBC - LiveNOW from FOX. TV n starts on channel n.
- * - REMOTES: four remotes sit on the bar, one per TV. Walk up to grab one;
- *   while holding it, T changes THAT TV's channel.
- * - CAPTIONS: on by default (C toggles). Uses embedded CEA-608/708 cues via
- *   hls.js when the stream carries them.
- * - SOUND: walk up to a TV and press V — that TV unmutes (others mute).
- *   Walk away and it mutes itself.
- * Dead/geo-blocked/CORS-poisoned streams auto-skip. Failure never breaks
- * the game — screens fall back to their idle art. */
